.TH RETA\-NATIVE 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reta\-native \- native Reta monolith executable
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reta\-native
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B reta\-native
is the compiled native Reta executable used for native parity and migration checks. The stable user command is reta.

.SH NOTES
This command is installed because it is a build or diagnostic target of the native Mojo port. Normal users usually start with .BR reta (1), .BR rp (1), .BR rpl (1), .BR rpe (1), or .BR rpb (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1)
